# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR [[cite:obs-642d2070823318a24f4a32c7b50ceefac641e126 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director [[cite:obs-721617371ca593c0a407592d4618a3a72cfa6bb9 "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
